!0!

"2"

Declaration R sort "DIGIT}+({Dot}{DIGIT}+)?". --  an intrinsic sort of real numbers.
Declaration TV sort. Declaration True:TV constant. Declaration False:TV constant.
Declaration sb sort. 


"1"

Declaration melilite sb:TV prime.
Declaration kalsilite sb:TV prime.
Declaration leucite sb:TV prime.
Declaration Ol sb:TV prime.                	-- for olivine.
Declaration Opx sb:TV.                      -- is not prime and we are looking forward for definition of orthopyroxene class of minerals.
Declaration Cpx sb:TV.                      -- is not prime and we are looking forward for definition of clinopyroxene class of minerals.
Declaration hornblende sb:TV prime.
Declaration garnet sb:TV prime.
Declaration spinel sb:TV prime.
Declaration biotite sb:TV prime.

"3"

Declaration Q sb:TV. Declaration A sb:TV. Declaration P sb:TV. Declaration F sb:TV. Declaration M sb:TV.

"4"

Declaration VPC (sb:TV):(sb:R).
Definition D_DVC_1 VPC(x)(y):((Volume_in(x,y)/Volume(y))*100).

"5"

Declaration Sample007:sb constant.

"6"

Axiom A_VPC_biotite_0 (∀x:sb (0 ≤ VPC(biotite)(x))).
Axiom A_VPC_biotite_100 (∀x:sb (VPC(biotite)(x) ≤ 100)).

